      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>1. MAIN ENGINE PROPULSION:</b>

    Press <b>[SPACE]</b> or <b>[W]</b> to ignite main plasma thruster. Apply gentle bursts to manage vertical momentum.


    <b>2. RCS LATERAL STABILIZATION:</b>

    Press <b>[A]</b> / <b>[D]</b> to rotate spacecraft attitude. Maintain upright orientation for landing.


    <b>3. HULL INTEGRITY & DAMAGE:</b>

    Impacting structures or terrain depletes Hull HP. Retrieve green <b>Nano-Repair Crates</b> in Sectors 2 & 3 to recover +25 HP.


    <b>4. LANDING ZONE PROTOCOL:</b>

    Touchdown on the cyan Landing Pad upright to initiate hyper-jump extraction.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
